Source: Reagan Library, George Shultz
                    Papers, Executive Secretariat Sensitive (05/18/1985–05/31/1985). Secret;
                    Sensitive. Drafted by Teicher on May 18;
                    cleared by Bishop, Johnson (P), and
                        Zweifel. Bishop initialed for Crocker. McKinley
                    initialed the memorandum and wrote: “20 May.”
